    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for listening. it's just all of it. like, i look at my bank account and then i look at my life and the math just doesn't work. no matter how much i grind, the numbers never stay ahead. it's not even about being \"sad\" anymore, it's just like... there's no exit. it's just a cycle of working to pay for the electricity to work more. it feels fundamentally broken.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
