      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being trapped in a self-perpetuating cycle is incredibly disheartening, and it speaks to a deep systemic issue, not a personal failing on your part. When the fundamental structure feels broken, the weight of it becomes unbearable. It's okay to acknowledge that this isn't just about \"math,\" it's about a broken system putting impossible demands on you. Perhaps we can look at ways to disrupt the cycle, even if it's just finding one small area to pause or change.",
      "source": "target",
