      "content": "i mean, \"disrupting the cycle\" sounds nice, but how? you can't disrupt a math equation. if the debt is more than the income, then the equation is just a zero. or a negative. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just stopped trying to solve it. like, if the debt collector comes, they can't really collect from someone who isn't there. it's like the only way to actually win is to just stop playing the game entirely.",
